> there is some masking/shifting done. It was tested with the factory
> waveforms of Kobo Clara HD, Tolino Shine 3, and Tolino Shine 2HD.
> Also the waveform called epdc_E060SCM.fw from NXP BSP works with the
> i.MX6SL devices.
>=20
